# Language
  Identifier: sem-lang/standard/document
  Version: 0.10.0
  Dependencies: sem-lang/standard/semantic

# Term
  Name: DocumentPurpose
  Description: The intended outcome described by a document section
  Meaning: Primitive/Value

# Term
  Name: DocumentTarget
  Description: The subject or value to which a document section applies
  Meaning: Primitive/Reference

# Term
  Name: CompletionCriteria
  Description: Conditions that determine whether an intended outcome is complete
  Meaning: Primitive/Predicate

# Term
  Name: EvidenceReference
  Description: A human-visible reference supporting a statement
  Meaning: Primitive/Reference

# Term
  Name: OrderedSteps
  Description: A sequence whose order is semantically significant
  Meaning: Primitive/Composition
